WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:03.433
FlyVIP is one private-jet club, written twice.

00:00:05.750 --> 00:00:11.150
Staff record a member's fee, and the same amount arrives as points straight away.

00:00:15.750 --> 00:00:21.017
Members pick their seats on a cabin map, and the points come off their balance.

00:00:25.750 --> 00:00:32.417
On a shared flight, each member pays for their own seats, and the first booker gets that share back.

00:00:35.750 --> 00:00:41.417
It was written in PHP first, then again in .NET, with the same styles and scripts.

00:00:42.250 --> 00:00:45.383
In both, the database refuses a double booking.

00:00:47.750 --> 00:00:51.550
The PHP build is live at flyvipcms.junaid.guru.
